# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Physics Demo — Bouncing Ball in a Cage, with Physics-Encoded Audio
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# A ball bounces inside a wireframe cage under real gravity.
# The tone it emits ENCODES the physics:
#   • pitch  ← height          (low floor → high ceiling)
#   • pitch  ← impact spikes    (each bounce kicks the frequency up)
#   • volume ← speed            (fast = loud, resting = quiet)
#   • pan    ← horizontal pos   (positional audio follows the ball)
#
# Coordinate convention (matches the room demos):
#   camera sits at the ORIGIN looking down +Z; the cage lives in front of it.
#   X: −HW … +HW   (left/right)
#   Y: −HH … +HH   (floor/ceiling)
#   Z:  ZN … ZF    (near/far, all positive — in front of the camera)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# Cage half-extents and depth window
令 HW = 3.2          # half width  (X spans −3.2 … +3.2)
令 HH = 2.6          # half height (Y spans −2.6 … +2.6)
令 ZN = 5.0          # near wall
令 ZF = 11.0         # far wall
令 ZC = 8.0          # cage centre depth

令 R  = 0.5          # ball radius

# Physics constants
令 GRAVITY    = 9.8
令 DAMPING    = 0.995    # mild air drag per frame
令 ELASTICITY = 0.86     # energy kept on each bounce
令 DT         = 0.0167   # ~60 FPS step

bind start = do {
    open_fullscreen("Physics Demo — Bouncing Ball")
    capture_mouse()
    set_ambient(0.14)

    ระดับเสียง(0.45)
    # one continuous voice we keep re-tuning from the physics state
    เสียงโทน(0, 0.0, 0.0, ZC, 4.0, 200.0, 0.06, 0.5, 0.02)

    # ── ball state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    令 bx = -1.4
    令 by =  2.0
    令 bz =  ZC
    令 vx =  3.4
    令 vy =  0.0
    令 vz =  2.1

    令 FR = 0
    令 lastBounce = -99

    ขณะที่ หน้าต่างเปิดอยู่() {
        เติม(2, 3, 10)            # deep navy backdrop

        # ── integrate physics ────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 vy = vy - GRAVITY * DT          # gravity

        令 vx = vx * DAMPING               # drag
        令 vy = vy * DAMPING
        令 vz = vz * DAMPING

        令 bx = bx + vx * DT               # advance position
        令 by = by + vy * DT
        令 bz = bz + vz * DT

        令 hit = 0

        # left / right walls
        若 bx < (0 - HW + R) { 令 bx = 0 - HW + R   令 vx = 0 - vx * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }
        若 bx > (HW - R)     { 令 bx = HW - R        令 vx = 0 - vx * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }

        # floor / ceiling
        若 by < (0 - HH + R) { 令 by = 0 - HH + R   令 vy = 0 - vy * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }
        若 by > (HH - R)     { 令 by = HH - R        令 vy = 0 - vy * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }

        # near / far walls
        若 bz < (ZN + R)     { 令 bz = ZN + R        令 vz = 0 - vz * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }
        若 bz > (ZF - R)     { 令 bz = ZF - R        令 vz = 0 - vz * ELASTICITY   令 hit = 1 }

        若 hit > 0 { 令 lastBounce = FR }

        # ── derived quantities ───────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 speed  = sqrt(vx*vx + vy*vy + vz*vz)
        令 hNorm  = (by + HH) / (2.0 * HH)      # 0 floor → 1 ceiling

        # ── PHYSICS-ENCODED AUDIO ────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 sinceHit  = FR - lastBounce
        令 impact    = 0.0
        若 sinceHit < 6 { 令 impact = (6 - sinceHit) * 26.0 }

        令 freq = 150.0 + hNorm * 180.0 + impact + speed * 22.0
        令 amp  = 0.04 + speed * 0.045
        令 pan  = bx / HW                        # −1 … +1 stereo
        เสียงโทน(0, bx, by, bz, 4.0, freq, amp, pan, 0.02)

        # ── lights track the ball so it always catches highlight ─────────────
        clear_lights()
        add_light(bx, by + 1.0, bz - 1.0, 4.0, 1.0, 0.95, 0.85)
        add_light(0.0, 0.0, ZN, 1.6, 0.25, 0.55, 1.0)

        # ── camera: stay at origin, gentle sway (NO set_camera_pos) ──────────
        令 t  = FR * 0.0065
        令 ry = sin(t) * 0.18
        令 rx = sin(t * 0.5) * 0.06
        set_camera(cos(ry), sin(ry), cos(rx), sin(rx))

        # ── draw the cage (set_color first, 0-255; line takes 6 args) ────────
        set_color(60, 120, 200)
        # bottom rectangle
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, 0-HH, ZN,  HW, 0-HH, ZN)
        draw_line_3d( HW, 0-HH, ZN,   HW, 0-HH, ZF)
        draw_line_3d( HW, 0-HH, ZF,  0-HW, 0-HH, ZF)
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, 0-HH, ZF, 0-HW, 0-HH, ZN)
        # top rectangle
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, HH, ZN,  HW, HH, ZN)
        draw_line_3d( HW, HH, ZN,   HW, HH, ZF)
        draw_line_3d( HW, HH, ZF,  0-HW, HH, ZF)
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, HH, ZF, 0-HW, HH, ZN)
        # vertical pillars
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, 0-HH, ZN, 0-HW, HH, ZN)
        draw_line_3d( HW, 0-HH, ZN,  HW, HH, ZN)
        draw_line_3d( HW, 0-HH, ZF,  HW, HH, ZF)
        draw_line_3d(0-HW, 0-HH, ZF, 0-HW, HH, ZF)

        # ── shadow on the floor (helps read height) ──────────────────────────
        set_color(0, 30, 60)
        draw_line_3d(bx - R, 0-HH, bz, bx + R, 0-HH, bz)
        draw_line_3d(bx, 0-HH, bz - R, bx, 0-HH, bz + R)

        # ── drop-line from ball to its floor shadow (shows altitude) ─────────
        set_color(40, 90, 140)
        draw_line_3d(bx, by - R, bz, bx, 0-HH, bz)

        # ── velocity arrow (red, length ∝ speed) ─────────────────────────────
        set_color(230, 60, 40)
        draw_line_3d(bx, by, bz, bx + vx * 0.18, by + vy * 0.18, bz + vz * 0.18)

        # ── THE BALL — energy-coloured chakra ────────────────────────────────
        # hue param cycles with speed so a hot ball reads warm, a slow one cool
        令 hue = 0.62 - hNorm * 0.55
        ลายจักร(bx, by, bz,  1,0,0,  0,1,0,  R, 7,  FR * 0.04, hue)

        แสดงผล()
        令 FR = FR + 1
    }
}
